cle>\n  <header class=\"container-fluid\">\n    \n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <section class=\"hero-panel\n      \n      \"\n    >\n      \n        <div class=\"hero-panel__image\"\n          role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Newsletters\"\n          style=\"background-image: url('/assets/Uploads/Interviews-Profiles_RGB__FillWzEyMDAsNjI1XQ.jpg');\"\n        ></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"container hero-panel__content\">\n        \n  <nav aria-label=\"Hierarchical navigation for parent pages\">\n    <ol class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n      \n        \n          <li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\">\n            <a href=\"/news-and-events\" class=\"breadcrumbs__text breadcrumbs__text--link\">News and Events</a>\n          </li>\n        \n      \n        \n      \n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n\n\n        <h1 class=\"hero-panel__text hero-panel__text--title\">Training Newsletter - June</h1>\n        \n          <p class=\"hero-panel__text hero-panel__text--summary lead\">Read about our latest Training news and upcoming training events happening across the country.</p>\n        \n        \n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n\n  </header>\n\n  <aside class=\"news__toolbar\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <time datetime=\"2026-06-04 09:20\" class=\"news__date col-12 col-md-3 col-xl-2\">\n          Published: 04 Jun 2026\n        </time>\n        \n          <nav aria-label=\"Article type and tags links\" class=\"news__tags col-12 col-md-9 col-xl-10\">\n            \n              <a href=\"/news-and-events?type=1\" class=\"tag-link\">News</a>\n            \n            \n          </nav>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"news-article\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-8 offset-lg-2\">\n        <p>REANNZ regularly hosts and facilitates a range of training events and capability-building initiatives for researchers and research communities.</p>\n<p>Our <strong>Training Newsletter for June 2026</strong> is now available to read online.</p>\n<p>This month we have updates on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Weekly Online Office Hours</li>\n<li>Online Workshop: Machine Learning 102 -- Image Analysis</li>\n<li>REANNZ at RezBas Aotearoa 2026</li>\n<li>Webinar: Using GPUs effectively - Tips &amp; tricks for maximising research impact</li>\n<li>Online Workshop: Introduction to R</li>\n<li>Open OnDemand Community Call: User Stories - University of Otago</li>\n<li>ARCOS Symposium 2026<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a title=\"REANNZ Training Newsletter - June 2026\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/reannz/upcoming-training-opportunities-jun2026-10592995\" target=\"_blank\">Read all the details here</a> or <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://reannz.us6.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=16e6cb3b8a0ab7d5e3c552153&amp;id=47dd2674e2\" target=\"_blank\">sign up to receive the newsletter</a> direct to your inbox.</p>\n<p>For a list of all training opportunities at REANNZ, <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/products-and-services/training-and-consultancy/training\" target=\"_blank\">visit our Training pages</a> complete with a Catalogue of options and Calendar of scheduled events.</p>\n<p>Questions? Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:training@reannz.co.nz?subject=Question%20about%20REANNZ&#039;s%20Training%20activities\">training@reannz.co.nz</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n      </main>\n\n      \n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  \n    <div class=\"footer__top\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n\n        \n          <section class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3 footer__block footer__block--network\">\n            <h6 class=\"footer__heading\">Network issues</h6>\n            \n              <a href=\"tel:0508 466 466\" class=\"footer__link footer__link--list\" aria-label=\"Telephone contact for network issues\">0508 466 466</a>\n            \n            \n              <a href=\"mailto:help@reannz.co.nz\" class=\"footer__link footer__link--list\" aria-label=\"Email for network issues\">help@reannz.co.nz</a>\n            \n            \n              <a href=\"https://reannz.status.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer__link footer__link--list\" aria-label=\"Link for Live Service Status page\">Live Service Status</a>\n            \n          </section>\n        \n\n        \n          <section class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3 footer__block footer__block--enquiries\">\n            <h6 class=\"footer__heading\">General enquiries</h6>\n            \n              <a href=\"tel:04 913 1090\" class=\"footer__link footer__link--list\" aria-label=\"Telephone contact for general enquiries\">04 913 1090</a>\n            \n\n            \n              <a href=\"mailto:info@reannz.co.nz\" class=\"footer__link footer__link--list\" aria-label=\"Email for general enquiries\">info@reannz.co.nz</a>\n            \n          </section>\n        \n\n        \n          <section class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3 footer__block footer__block--connect\">\n            <h6 class=\"footer__heading\">Connect with us</h6>\n            \n\n            \n              <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/reannz\" class=\"footer__link footer__link--list footer__link--linkedin\" aria-label=\"View our LinkedIn page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LinkedIn</a>\n            \n          </section>\n        \n\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  <div class=\"footer__bottom\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-2 footer__block footer__block--logo\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.reannz.co.nz\">\n          <img src=\"/_resources/themes/app/dist/images/logo-white.svg?m=1782312363\" alt=\"Research and Education Advanced Network New Zealand Logo\" />\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n      \n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-xl-5 footer__block footer__block--nav\">\n          <nav aria-label=\"Legal navigation\">\n            \n              <a href=\"/privacy\" class=